      "summary": "R16: DistributedMatmul multi-GPU row-split+all-gather path implemented (matmul_multi_gpu) and verified thread-per-rank on 2 GPUs: MultiGpu_RowSplitAllGather + MultiGpu_AlphaBeta pass (13/13 DistributedMatmul), stable across repeated runs. Supersedes the \"multi-process required\" assumption: R15 proved genuine multi-GPU NCCL works thread-per-rank."
